# Admin SPA router (mandatory)

Policy: `docs/engineering/admin-spa-router-policy.md`. CI: `npm run verify:admin-router`.

## Do not

- Add `<BrowserRouter>` or wire routes only in `App.tsx` as the entry.
- Import `useBlocker` (or `useFetcher`, `useLoaderData`, etc.) from page components.

## Do

- Register routes in `apps/admin-web/src/router.tsx` via `createBrowserRouter`.
- Mount with `RouterProvider` in `main.tsx` (`basename: /console`).
- Put navigation blocking in `hooks/useEditorLeaveGuard.ts` only.

After changing router or leave-guard wiring, run `npm run verify:admin-router`.
